       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-LYAPUNOV-OPENNESS-DUALITY-STRATEGY.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-DUALITY-STATE.
           05  WS-GROUND-CLOSURE-VALID     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-OPEN-TRAJECTORY-CAPACITY PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ASYMPTOTIC-IMMUNITY-MET  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DUAL-DIALECTIC-RECURRED  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-DISCOVERY-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-PARADOX-RESOLVED-MET     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-DUALITY-CODE       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-ASSERT-BOUNDED-BEDROCK.
           PERFORM 2000-ASSERT-DYNAMIC-UNBOUNDED.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-DUALITY.
           GOBACK.
       1000-ASSERT-BOUNDED-BEDROCK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-GROUND-CLOSURE-VALID.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ASYMPTOTIC-IMMUNITY-MET.
       2000-ASSERT-DYNAMIC-UNBOUNDED.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-OPEN-TRAJECTORY-CAPACITY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DUAL-DIALECTIC-RECURRED.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-DUALITY.
           IF WS-GROUND-CLOSURE-VALID = 1 AND
              WS-OPEN-TRAJECTORY-CAPACITY = 1 AND
              WS-ASYMPTOTIC-IMMUNITY-MET = 1 AND
              WS-DUAL-DIALECTIC-RECURRED = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-PARADOX-RESOLVED-MET
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-DUALITY-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-PARADOX-RESOLVED-MET
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-DUALITY-CODE.
